From 13d090c4391199e80dd744d4e82b56d48170320d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:25:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix slow voucher connect; add Company-controlled billing
 cycle (Subscribe / Pay all shareholders)

- connect_voucher_device: write InternetSession.login_time BEFORE queuing the bypass job so voucher_status sees it as connected as soon as the agent finishes.
- voucher_status: re-queue the bypass if the first job failed (never while one is pending, never for expired vouchers).
- EarningsPeriod/ShareholderPayout models + migration 0011.
- Admin-only Subscribe (closes cycle, day one of next starts when you choose) and Pay all shareholders (marks paid + emails each their amount).
- Revenue dashboard and withdrawals now follow the cycle instead of the calendar month.
